<title>USA: Great Financial Q3 net loss after charge.</title>
<headline>Great Financial Q3 net loss after charge.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended   Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				  September 30,	 September 30,</p>
<p>				  1996	 1995	1996     1995</p>
<p> Net interest income     19,524    16,152    56,344    46,003</p>
<p>Provision for loan</p>
<p>  losses			  675	 575     1,911     1,678</p>
<p> Net non-interest income  9,223     7,790    26,919    21,535</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	 ( 387)     5,713    12,605    16,220</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per</p>
<p>  common share	    ( 0.03)	0.39	0.88	1.07</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 96 includes charge of $6.3 million, net of taxes, taken in response to legislation passed by Congress designed to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Full company name is Great Financial Corp.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
